      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:0/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": "Understanding the Opcode column:",
      "source_hash": 11589089296528423986,
      "context_hash": 1691765838109469102,
      "translation": "옵코드 열 이해하기:",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "opcode": "옵코드"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-10-25T06:17:27.642126Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:0/block:2/seg:0",
      "source": "Any hexadecimal digits (0-9, A-F) that appear in an opcode are interpreted literally, and are used to determine the operation in question.",
      "source_hash": 10346573679610470751,
      "context_hash": 4116866623465880934,
      "translation": "옵코드에 나타나는 16진수 숫자(0-9, A-F)는 문자 그대로 해석되며, 해당 연산을 결정하는 데 사용됩니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "hexadecimal": "16진수",
        "opcode": "옵코드"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-10-25T06:17:27.642126Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:0/block:3/seg:0",
      "source": "The X or Y wild card uses the value stored in VX/VY.",
      "source_hash": 6196422302251937553,
      "context_hash": 1679314914351955841,
      "translation": "X 또는 Y 와일드카드는 VX/VY에 저장된 값을 사용합니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-10-25T06:17:27.642126Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:0/block:4/seg:0",
      "source": "N refers to a literal hexadecimal value.",
      "source_hash": 9754257135106324990,
      "context_hash": 1692491020574436545,
      "translation": "N은 리터럴 16진수 값을 나타냅니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "hexadecimal": "16진수"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-10-25T06:17:27.642127Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:0/block:4/seg:1",
      "source": "NN or NNN refer to two or three digit hex numbers respectively.",
      "source_hash": 11163134604710319046,
      "context_hash": 7550461792037096477,
      "translation": "NN과 NNN은 각각 두 자리와 세 자리 16진수를 나타냅니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-10-25T06:17:27.642127Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:0/block:5/seg:0",
      "source": "Example: The instruction 0xD123 would match with the `DXYN` opcode, where VX is V1, VY is V2, and N is 3 (draw a 8x3 sprite at (V1, V2))",
      "source_hash": 6643267367516153964,
      "context_hash": 10612354220167848462,
      "translation": "예: 명령어 0xD123은 `DXYN` 옵코드와 일치하며, 이때 VX는 V1, VY는 V2, N은 3입니다((V1, V2) 위치에 8x3 스프라이트를 그립니다)",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "instruction": "명령어",
        "opcode": "옵코드",
        "sprite": "스프라이트"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-10-25T06:17:27.642127Z",
      "issues": []
    },
